    "chunk_text": "yld up ongean \u00f0as burh Hai; ic \u00f0e forgyfe hi. He ahefde sona his scyld, & \u00f0\u00e6t gesawon \u00f0a o\u00f0re, \u00f0e lutedon on \u00f0\u00e6re dygelnysse, swa swa him dihte Seo buruhwaru \u00f0a beseah underb\u00e6c sona & gesawon \u00f0one smic swy\u00f0e heage astigan, & ne mihton Iosue \u00f0a geseah \u00f0\u00e6t seo burh w\u00e6s gegan & feaht him wi\u00f0 sona & his geferan wi\u00f0hindon, & ofslogon \u00d0one cyningc hi brohton cucene to Iosue, \u00f0one he het ahon on heagum gealgum. Twelf \u00f0usenda \u00f0\u00e6r feollon on \u00f0am gefeohte ofslagene, wera & wifa. & Iosue worhte \u00f0a an weofod Gode, of ungeworhtum stanum, & his lac \u00f0\u00e6r geofrode \u00f0am lyfiendan \u00d0ES hlisa wear\u00f0 \u00f0a cu\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6ra leoda cyningum \u00f0e begeondan Iordane eardiende w\u00e6ron. & gesamnodon hi ealle anmodlice to gefeohte togeanes Iosue & Israhela bearnum. Hw\u00e6t \u00f0a Gabanitiscean gamenlice r\u00e6ddon, & mid geaplicre fare ferdon to Iosue. Namon him ealde gescy & unornlic scrud & fynige hlafas, & forwerede f\u00e6telsas & geclutode bytta. & cw\u00e6don to Iosue; We comon, leof, feorran of fyrlenum lande, & we gewilnia\u00f0 fri\u00f0es & Hi andwyrdon Iosue & Israhela bearnum \u00f0us: We gehyrdon eowerne hlisan, hu se lyfigenda God eow \u00d0a cw\u00e6don ure frynd",
